<section class="crisis" id="crisis" aria-labelledby="crisis-h">
  <div class="crisis__h"><h2 id="crisis-h">Need help now?</h2><p>If you're in danger or thinking about ending your life, please reach out now.</p></div>
  <ul>
    <li data-reveal><strong>In immediate danger in Jamaica:</strong> police 119, ambulance and fire 110.</li>
    <li data-reveal><strong>Jamaica:</strong> Mental Health and Suicide Prevention Helpline, <a href="tel:8886395433">888-NEW-LIFE (888-639-5433)</a>.</li>
    <li data-reveal><strong>Jamaica, ages 16 to 24:</strong> U-Matter, free text counselling. Text SUPPORT on WhatsApp or SMS to 876-838-4897. It's a chat service, not an emergency line.</li>
    <li data-reveal><strong>US:</strong> in an emergency call <a href="tel:911">911</a>. To talk to someone, call or text <a href="tel:988">988</a>, any time.</li>
    <li data-reveal><strong>Canada:</strong> in an emergency call <a href="tel:911">911</a>. To talk to someone, call or text <a href="tel:988">9-8-8</a>, any time.</li>
    <li data-reveal><strong>UK and Ireland:</strong> in an emergency call <a href="tel:999">999</a>. To talk to someone, call Samaritans free on <a href="tel:116123">116 123</a>, day or night.</li>
    <li data-reveal><strong>Anywhere else:</strong> call your local emergency number, or find a free, confidential helpline at <a href="https://findahelpline.com">findahelpline.com</a>.</li>
  </ul>
</section>
